{"id":54020,"date":"2024-11-12T08:43:09","title":{"rendered":"M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u00e1ng t\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi v\u00e0 10 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-one-full fusion-column-first fusion-column-last\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-column-wrapper-legacy\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kinh t\u1ebf th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ed1i m\u1eb7t v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u r\u1ee7i ro, th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c nh\u01b0ng d\u1ea7n \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh khi th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i, \u00e1p l\u1ef1c l\u1ea1m ph\u00e1t gi\u1ea3m d\u1ea7n, \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1edbi l\u1ecfng, ngu\u1ed3n cung lao \u0111\u1ed9ng gia t\u0103ng. Trong n\u01b0\u1edbc, tr\u01b0\u1edbc nh\u1eefng kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n c\u1ee7a b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh kinh t\u1ebf th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi n\u00f3i chung v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i t\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n kinh t\u1ebf, Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7, Th\u1ee7 t\u01b0\u1edbng Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ea1o quy\u1ebft li\u1ec7t c\u00e1c B\u1ed9, ng\u00e0nh v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng nghi\u00eam t\u00fac, quy\u1ebft li\u1ec7t th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p \u0111\u1ec1 ra trong Ngh\u1ecb quy\u1ebft s\u1ed1 01\/NQ-CP v\u1ec1 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i; Ngh\u1ecb\u00a0quy\u1ebft\u00a002\/NQ-CP\u00a0v\u1ec1 nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5, gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng kinh doanh, n\u00e2ng cao n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c c\u1ea1nh tranh qu\u1ed1c gia; Ngh\u1ecb quy\u1ebft phi\u00ean h\u1ecdp Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 th\u01b0\u1eddng k\u1ef3 h\u1eb1ng th\u00e1ng; Ngh\u1ecb quy\u1ebft s\u1ed1 143\/NQ-CP ng\u00e0y 17\/9\/2024 v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5, gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p tr\u1ecdng t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u1ea9n tr\u01b0\u01a1ng kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c h\u1eadu qu\u1ea3 b\u00e3o s\u1ed1 3. T\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc ta duy tr\u00ec xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c, c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh, l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3p v\u00e0o t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 n\u0103m. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u00e1ng v\u1ec1 t\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi v\u00e0 m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc ta nh\u01b0 sau:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(1) K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t l\u00faa h\u00e8 thu \u0111\u1ea1t kh\u00e1, di\u1ec7n t\u00edch gieo c\u1ea5y l\u00faa thu \u0111\u00f4ng v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2y rau m\u00e0u v\u1ee5 \u0111\u00f4ng t\u0103ng so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; ch\u0103n nu\u00f4i l\u1ee3n v\u00e0 gia c\u1ea7m nh\u00ecn chung \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh; nhu c\u1ea7u g\u1ed7 nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u t\u0103ng khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00e2n \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh khai th\u00e1c; s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u00e1 tra v\u00e0 t\u00f4m n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ee3 t\u0103ng cao, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng trong n\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u.<\/em><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u0103ng su\u1ea5t l\u00faa h\u00e8 thu \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 58,1 t\u1ea1\/ha, t\u0103ng 0,5 t\u1ea1\/ha so v\u1edbi v\u1ee5 h\u00e8 thu n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 11,1 tri\u1ec7u t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 77,6 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n. Di\u1ec7n t\u00edch gieo s\u1ea1 l\u00faa thu \u0111\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ea1t 710,7 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 2,6% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc. Di\u1ec7n t\u00edch m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2y rau m\u00e0u v\u1ee5 \u0111\u00f4ng t\u0103ng kh\u00e1: Ng\u00f4 \u0111\u1ea1t 53 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 7,7%; rau, \u0111\u1eadu c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ea1t 77,0 ngh\u00ecn, t\u0103ng 7,5%; l\u1ea1c \u0111\u1ea1t 3,5 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 5,5%; khoai lang \u0111\u1ea1t 7,2 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 2,0%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e0n l\u1ee3n v\u00e0 gia c\u1ea7m ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 nhu c\u1ea7u ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng t\u0103ng cao nh\u1eefng th\u00e1ng cu\u1ed1i n\u0103m. T\u1ed5ng \u0111\u00e0n l\u1ee3n t\u1ea1i th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng 10\/2024 t\u0103ng 2,4% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; \u0111\u00e0n gia c\u1ea7m t\u0103ng 2,6%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 1: <\/strong><strong>T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng s\u1ed1 \u0111\u00e0n l\u1ee3n, \u0111\u00e0n gia c\u1ea7m cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng 10\/2024 so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-54029 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27294%27%20height%3D%27161%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20294%20161%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27294%27%20height%3D%27161%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/1-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"294\" height=\"161\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng g\u1ed7 khai th\u00e1c th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 2.420,8 ngh\u00ecn m<sup>3<\/sup>, t\u0103ng 14,7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc do nhu c\u1ea7u g\u1ed7 nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 m\u00e1y ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn t\u0103ng cao, gi\u00e1 g\u1ed7 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u00e3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u1ef1c khai th\u00e1c; t\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u0111\u1ea1t 18,5 tri\u1ec7u m<sup>3<\/sup>, t\u0103ng 7,9%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u c\u00e1 tra t\u0103ng c\u1ea3 v\u1ec1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e1<a href=\"#_ftn1\" name=\"_ftnref1\">[1]<\/a>, gi\u00e1 t\u00f4m n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ee3 duy tr\u00ec m\u1ee9c t\u0103ng \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh n\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi nu\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng thu ho\u1ea1ch. T\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024, s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u00e1 tra \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 1.440,2 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 4,7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u00f4m \u0111\u1ea1t 1.106,9 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 5%, trong \u0111\u00f3 t\u00f4m s\u00fa \u0111\u1ea1t 234,8 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 2,6%; t\u00f4m th\u1ebb ch\u00e2n tr\u1eafng \u0111\u1ea1t 798,9 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 5,8%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(2) <\/em><em>Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi \u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, t\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 t\u0103ng 8,3%.<\/em> Trong \u0111\u00f3, ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t ng\u00e0nh ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn, ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1o t\u0103ng 9,6%; ng\u00e0nh s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u0103ng 10,3%, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ee7 nhu c\u1ea7u ti\u00eau th\u1ee5 v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n kinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 2: T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p (%)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-54022 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27516%27%20height%3D%27302%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20516%20302%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27516%27%20height%3D%27302%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"516\" height=\"302\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 nh\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb mua h\u00e0ng (PMI) th\u00e1ng 10\/2024 \u0111\u1ea1t 51,2 \u0111i\u1ec3m, cho th\u1ea5y c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t \u0111\u00e3 ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd sau b\u00e3o s\u1ed1 3<a href=\"#_ftn2\" name=\"_ftnref2\"><sup>[2]<\/sup><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp m\u1edbi th\u00e1ng 10\/2024 t\u0103ng tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i sau ba th\u00e1ng s\u1ee5t gi\u1ea3m li\u00ean ti\u1ebfp<a href=\"#_ftn3\" name=\"_ftnref3\"><sup>[3]<\/sup><\/a>, \u0111\u1ea1t 14,2 ngh\u00ecn doanh nghi\u1ec7p, t\u0103ng 26,5% so v\u1edbi th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc. T\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng, s\u1ed1 doanh nghi\u1ec7p gia nh\u1eadp th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ea1t 202,3 ngh\u00ecn doanh nghi\u1ec7p, cao h\u01a1n s\u1ed1 doanh nghi\u1ec7p r\u00fat lui kh\u1ecfi th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng (173,2 ngh\u00ecn doanh nghi\u1ec7p).<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 3: S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp m\u1edbi c\u00e1c th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 (\u0110VT: Doanh nghi\u1ec7p)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-54023 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27610%27%20height%3D%27380%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20610%20380%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27610%27%20height%3D%27380%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"610\" height=\"380\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<em>(3) C\u00e1c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch th\u1ecb th\u1ef1c thu\u1eadn l\u1ee3i, x\u00fac ti\u1ebfn du l\u1ecbch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh n\u00ean kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u0103ng cao.<\/em> Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn n\u01b0\u1edbc ta th\u00e1ng 10\/2024 \u0111\u1ea1t 1,42 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t ng\u01b0\u1eddi, t\u0103ng 27,6% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea1t h\u01a1n 14,1 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t ng\u01b0\u1eddi, t\u0103ng 41,3%. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00edn hi\u1ec7u t\u00edch c\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u00f3n 18 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t kh\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a n\u0103m 2024.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 4: Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn Vi\u1ec7t Nam 10 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 ph\u00e2n theo v\u00f9ng l\u00e3nh th\u1ed5<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-54024\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27600%27%20height%3D%27301%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20600%20301%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27600%27%20height%3D%27301%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"301\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(4) Nhu c\u1ea7u ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng t\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng cu\u1ed1i n\u0103m t\u0103ng, l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ef1c cho xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u0103ng cao v\u00e0 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/em> T\u1ed5ng kim ng\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t, nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 s\u01a1 b\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ea1t 647,87 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 15,8% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, trong \u0111\u00f3 xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u t\u0103ng 14,9%; nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u t\u0103ng 16,8%. Trong m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 c\u00f3 31 m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea1t kim ng\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u tr\u00ean 1 t\u1ef7 USD, chi\u1ebfm 92,6% t\u1ed5ng kim ng\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u (trong \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 7 m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u \u0111\u1ea1t tr\u00ean 10 t\u1ef7 USD, chi\u1ebfm 66,5%).<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 5: Xu\u1ea5t, nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a 10 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-54025\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27600%27%20height%3D%27184%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20600%20184%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27600%27%20height%3D%27184%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"184\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1n c\u00e2n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 s\u01a1 b\u1ed9 xu\u1ea5t si\u00eau 23,31 t\u1ef7 USD (c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc xu\u1ea5t si\u00eau 24,8 t\u1ef7 USD), g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ef7 gi\u00e1, t\u0103ng d\u1ef1 tr\u1eef ngo\u1ea1i h\u1ed1i c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n kinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(5) Thu h\u00fat \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i t\u0103ng cao v\u1ec1 v\u1ed1n \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh, cho th\u1ea5y c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 tin t\u01b0\u1edfng Vi\u1ec7t Nam l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 quan tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng quy m\u00f4 c\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0.<\/em><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y 31\/10\/2024, c\u1ea3 n\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f3 1.151 d\u1ef1 \u00e1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh t\u0103ng v\u1ed1n v\u1edbi s\u1ed1 v\u1ed1n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u0103ng th\u00eam \u0111\u1ea1t g\u1ea7n 8,35 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 6% v\u1ec1 s\u1ed1 d\u1ef1 \u00e1n v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 41,7% v\u1ec1 s\u1ed1 v\u1ed1n so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m 2023. V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u0111\u1ea1t 19,6 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 8,8% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 6: V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00e0o Vi\u1ec7t Nam 10 th\u00e1ng c\u00e1c n\u0103m 2020-2024 (T\u1ef7 USD)<a href=\"#_ftn4\" name=\"_ftnref4\"><sup>[4]<\/sup><\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-54026 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27611%27%20height%3D%27273%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20611%20273%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27611%27%20height%3D%27273%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"611\" height=\"273\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(6) L\u1ea1m ph\u00e1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t \u1edf m\u1ee9c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c cho t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng kinh t\u1ebf.<\/em> Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 gi\u00e1 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng (CPI) th\u00e1ng m\u01b0\u1eddi n\u0103m 2024 so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 2,89%, th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 c\u00e1c n\u0103m 2022 v\u00e0 2023 (4,3% v\u00e0 3,59%); b\u00ecnh qu\u00e2n m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng CPI t\u0103ng 3,78%, \u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ea3 n\u0103m 2024 c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau Qu\u1ed1c h\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ec1 ra l\u00e0 4%-4,5%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 7: T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng\/gi\u1ea3m ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 gi\u00e1 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng th\u00e1ng 10 v\u00e0 10 th\u00e1ng so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00e1c n\u0103m 2020-2024 (%)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-54027 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27503%27%20height%3D%27320%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20503%20320%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27503%27%20height%3D%27320%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"503\" height=\"320\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(7) Thu ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng cao, ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh s\u1ef1 ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i t\u00edch c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t, kinh doanh.<\/em> Thu ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 1.654,2 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, b\u1eb1ng 97,2% d\u1ef1 to\u00e1n n\u0103m v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 17,3% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; trong \u0111\u00f3 thu n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 1.377,6 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, b\u1eb1ng 95,4% v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 18,1%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 8: Thu, chi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc 10 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-54031\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27600%27%20height%3D%27173%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20600%20173%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27600%27%20height%3D%27173%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/8-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"173\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(8) C\u00f4ng t\u00e1c b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m an sinh x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i lu\u00f4n \u0111\u01b0\u01a1\u0323c ca\u0301c c\u00e2\u0301p, nga\u0300nh th\u01b0\u0323c hi\u00ea\u0323n k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/em> Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7, c\u00e1c B\u1ed9, ng\u00e0nh, \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00e2n g\u1ea7n 21,8 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n g\u1ea1o c\u1ee9u \u0111\u00f3i v\u00e0 c\u00e1c h\u1ed9 ngh\u00e8o, c\u1eadn ngh\u00e8o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"#_ftnref1\" name=\"_ftn1\">[1]<\/a>\u00a0 https:\/\/agromonitor.vn\/post\/477904\/xuat-khau-ca-tra-tuan-2-10-8-10-tang-7-ve-luong-va-14-ve-tri-gia-so-voi-tuan-truoc-do.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"#_ftnref2\" name=\"_ftn2\">[2]<\/a> S&amp;P global (Th\u00e1ng 11\/2024), \u201cTh\u00f4ng c\u00e1o b\u00e1o ch\u00ed: Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 PMI ng\u00e0nh s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t Vi\u1ec7t Nam\u201d, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.pmi.spglobal.com\/Public\/Home\/PressRelease\/4e442d4b2f9e46ecaf8e3748361a4650\">https:\/\/www.pmi.spglobal.com\/Public\/Home\/PressRelease\/4e442d4b2f9e46ecaf8e3748361a4650<\/a>, \u00a0truy c\u1eadp ng\u00e0y 02\/11\/2024.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"#_ftnref3\" name=\"_ftn3\">[3]<\/a> S\u1ed1 doanh nghi\u1ec7p th\u00e0nh l\u1eadp m\u1edbi trong th\u00e1ng 7\/2024 gi\u1ea3m 6,3%; th\u00e1ng 8\/2024 gi\u1ea3m 15,2%; th\u00e1ng 9\/2024 gi\u1ea3m 16,3%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"#_ftnref4\" name=\"_ftn4\">[4]<\/a> C\u00e1c n\u0103m 2020-2022 t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ebft 20\/8 h\u00e0ng n\u0103m, n\u0103m 2023 v\u00e0 n\u0103m 2024 t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ebft 31\/8.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"fusion-clearfix\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-2 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-1 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-color:#f2f2f2;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-2\"><hr \/>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-fusion-800 wp-image-41615 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"146\" srcset=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27800%27%20height%3D%27146%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20800%20146%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27800%27%20height%3D%27146%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-200x37.png 200w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-300x55.png 300w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-400x73.png 400w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-600x110.png 600w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-768x141.png 768w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png 800w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1024x187.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1200x220.png 1200w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1536x281.png 1536w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-orig-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-3 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-2 fusion_builder_column_1_6 1_6 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:16.666666666667%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:11.52%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:11.52%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-3 fusion_builder_column_5_6 5_6 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:83.333333333333%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:2.304%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:2.304%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-3\"><div class=\"document-type-news\"><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/10\/nhung-tin-hieu-tich-cuc-cua-thi-truong-lao-dong-trong-9-thang-nam-2026\/\">Nh\u1eefng t\u00edn hi\u1ec7u t\u00edch c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng trong 9 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2026<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam trong 9 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2026 c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u chuy\u1ec3n bi\u1ebfn t\u00edch c\u1ef1c. L\u1ef1c l\u01b0\u1ee3ng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m t\u0103ng, thu nh\u1eadp b\u00ecnh qu\u00e2n th\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi lao \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n; t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng thi\u1ebfu vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m, lao \u0111\u1ed9ng phi ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 lao \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1ebft ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng gi\u1ea3m. \u0110\u00e1ng ch\u00fa \u00fd, c\u01a1 c\u1ea5u lao \u0111\u1ed9ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c chuy\u1ec3n d\u1ecbch theo h\u01b0\u1edbng gi\u1ea3m t\u1ef7 tr\u1ecdng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng khu v\u1ef1c n\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p, t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 tr\u1ecdng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng trong khu v\u1ef1c c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng, khu v\u1ef1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m trong c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ed1 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng. <span>(12\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/08\/phat-trien-y-hoc-co-truyen-viet-nam-gan-voi-cham-soc-suc-khoe-nhan-dan-va-phat-trien-dat-nuoc\/\">Ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n Vi\u1ec7t Nam g\u1eafn v\u1edbi ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n g\u1eafn tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi gi\u1eef g\u00ecn b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc v\u0103n h\u00f3a d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p d\u01b0\u1ee3c li\u1ec7u, kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao s\u1ee9c m\u1ea1nh m\u1ec1m qu\u1ed1c gia. V\u00ec v\u1eady, c\u1ea7n b\u1ea3o t\u1ed3n, ph\u00e1t huy v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng t\u1ea7m y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c, bi\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb, di s\u1ea3n qu\u00fd b\u00e1u c\u1ee7a cha \u00f4ng th\u00e0nh ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ef1c quan tr\u1ecdng ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc trong th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 m\u1edbi. <span>(10\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/hoan-thien-quy-dinh-ve-pho-bien-thong-tin-thong-ke-quoc-gia\/\">Ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea qu\u1ed1c gia<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch c\u00f3 vai tr\u00f2 quan tr\u1ecdng trong c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf - x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i. Vi\u1ec7c Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 ban h\u00e0nh Ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ed1 13\/2026\/N\u0110-CP ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u01a1 s\u1edf ph\u00e1p l\u00fd v\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea qu\u1ed1c gia, n\u00e2ng cao hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 c\u00f4ng b\u1ed1, cung c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u1edbi. <span>(21\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/chuan-hoa-che-do-bao-cao-thong-ke-cap-quoc-gia-phuc-vu-cong-tac-quan-ly-va-dieu-hanh\/\">Chu\u1ea9n h\u00f3a ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00e1o c\u00e1o th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u1ea5p qu\u1ed1c gia ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>D\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng quan tr\u1ecdng ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf - x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i. Vi\u1ec7c Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 ban h\u00e0nh Ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ed1 139\/2026\/N\u0110-CP g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u1ea5p qu\u1ed1c gia; n\u00e2ng cao ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cung c\u1ea5p, t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u1edbi. <span>(21\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/thong-ke-noi-vung-bien\/\">Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea n\u01a1i v\u00f9ng bi\u00ean<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>18 n\u0103m l\u00e0m ngh\u1ec1, anh Nguy\u1ec5n V\u0103n To\u00e0n, Tr\u01b0\u1edfng Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u01a1 s\u1edf N\u00e0 H\u1ef3, t\u1ec9nh \u0110i\u1ec7n Bi\u00ean kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 qu\u00ean nh\u1eefng l\u1ea7n c\u00f9ng \u0103n, c\u00f9ng ng\u1ee7 v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u00e0o d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c L\u00e0o, d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c M\u00f4ng, d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c Th\u00e1i. <span>(06\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/nganh-thong-ke-hoi-nhap-tinh-toan-gdp-theo-chuan-quoc-te\/\">Ng\u00e0nh th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadp, t\u00ednh to\u00e1n GDP theo chu\u1ea9n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>S\u1ef1 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a U\u1ef7 ban Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea Li\u00ean H\u1ee3p qu\u1ed1c, UNDP, WB, ADB, IFC, ILO nh\u1eefng n\u0103m sau \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi \u0111\u00e3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadp qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u00e0nh th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea, n\u00e2ng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea Vi\u1ec7t Nam theo chu\u1ea9n m\u1ef1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf. <span>(05\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"document-type-archive\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><a href=\"\/tin-tuc-khac\">Xem th\u00eam<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-4 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-4 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-widget-area awb-widget-area-element fusion-widget-area-1 fusion-content-widget-area post-taxonomy-metadata\" style=\"--awb-title-color:#333333;--awb-padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-additional-widget-content\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/p>\n","protected":false}}